// Title: Directory Service Restore Mode(DSRM) Registry Value Tampering
// Rule ID: b61e87c0-50db-4b2e-8986-6a2be94b33b0
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.credential-access, attack.persistence, attack.t1556
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_dsrm_tampering.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
